# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout, regardless of
# platform or a client's core.autocrlf setting (this repo is edited from both
# WSL and Windows-native tools against the same /mnt/d checkout, which is what
# caused CRLF churn in the first place).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binaries — never touch line endings, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
